---
// Aether Final CTA Section
---

<section class='py-24 sm:py-32 px-6 bg-gradient-to-b from-dark-950 via-red-950/10 to-dark-950 relative overflow-hidden'>
  <!-- Background Glow -->
  <div class='absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-r from-red-500/5 via-rose-500/10 to-red-500/5 blur-3xl' aria-hidden='true'></div>

  <div class='mx-auto max-w-4xl text-center relative z-10'>
    <h2 class='gsap-fadein text-4xl md:text-6xl font-bold text-white mb-6'>
      Bereit, <span class='text-transparent bg-clip-text bg-gradient-to-r from-red-400 to-rose-500'>Aether</span> zu nutzen?
    </h2>
    <p class='gsap-fadein text-xl md:text-2xl text-light-300 mb-12 max-w-2xl mx-auto' style='animation-delay: 0.15s'>
      Starte kostenlos mit Particle oder wähle den Plan, der zu deinem Workflow passt.
    </p>

    <div class='gsap-fadein flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-4 justify-center items-center' style='animation-delay: 0.3s'>
      <a 
        href='https://aether.waldheim.dev' 
        class='gsap-btn inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-8 py-4 rounded-lg bg-gradient-to-r from-red-500 to-rose-600 text-white text-lg font-semibold hover:shadow-lg hover:shadow-red-500/50 transition-all'
        aria-label='Aether kostenlos starten mit Particle'
      >
        <i class='fa-solid fa-rocket' aria-hidden='true'></i>
        Kostenlos starten
      </a>
      <a 
        href='/aether/#pricing' 
        class='gsap-btn inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-8 py-4 rounded-lg bg-dark-800 border border-red-500/30 text-white text-lg font-semibold hover:border-red-500/50 hover:shadow-lg hover:shadow-red-500/30 transition-all'
        aria-label='Wave oder Matter Abo abschließen'
      >
        <i class='fa-solid fa-crown' aria-hidden='true'></i>
        Wave / Matter testen
      </a>
    </div>

    <!-- Trust Badges -->
    <div class='gsap-fadein mt-16 flex flex-wrap justify-center gap-8 text-light-400 text-sm' style='animation-delay: 0.45s'>
      <div class='flex items-center gap-2'>
        <i class='fa-solid fa-check-circle text-red-400' aria-hidden='true'></i>
        <span>Keine Kreditkarte erforderlich</span>
      </div>
      <div class='flex items-center gap-2'>
        <i class='fa-solid fa-check-circle text-red-400' aria-hidden='true'></i>
        <span>Monatlich kündbar</span>
      </div>
      <div class='flex items-center gap-2'>
        <i class='fa-solid fa-check-circle text-red-400' aria-hidden='true'></i>
        <span>DSGVO-konform</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
